#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-zero-cdn-asset-localizer.php
msgid "Checks the front page for Google Fonts, Font Awesome, cdnjs, jsDelivr and unpkg references and downloads a Google Fonts stylesheet with its WOFF2 files to the site's own uploads folder. Replacing the remote link in the theme stays a manual step."
msgstr ""

